## 2️⃣ Frontend `.gitignore` – mostly correct ✅

Your `.gitignore` is **almost perfect**.  
Here’s the **final recommended version** 👇

```gitignore
# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output
build/

# Environment variables (never commit secrets)
.env
.env.local
.env.development
.env.production

# Logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# OS / Editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/